Files: assets/fonts/NotoSans*.ttf assets/fonts/LICENSE-NotoSans.txt
Copyright: 2022 The Noto Project Authors
 2014-2021 Adobe
Comment: Subsets of Noto Sans Devanagari UI and Noto Sans CJK SC, cut down to
 the characters this login screen draws. Roboto carries no Devanagari and no
 Han, so without them the Hindi and Chinese columns are rows of empty boxes.
 Neither family declares a Reserved Font Name, so the subsets keep their
 original names.
License: OFL-1.1
 The complete SIL Open Font License version 1.1 is available in
 /usr/share/doc/cedm/LICENSE-NotoSans.txt and at
 https://openfontlicense.org.

Files: third_party/lxb-gilrs/* third_party/lxb-gilrs-core/*
Copyright: 2016-2018 Mateusz Sieczko and other GilRs Developers
License: Apache-2.0 or Expat
Comment: GilRs 0.11.2 and gilrs-core 0.6.8 as LineXinBar carries them, the
 second with one local change described in
 third_party/lxb-gilrs-core/README.LXB.md: a hot-plug event is no longer left
 unread behind another. The Apache License version 2.0 is available in
 /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0 on Debian systems.

Files: third_party/lxb-gilrs/SDL_GameControllerDB/*
Copyright: 1997-2025 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>
License: Zlib
Comment: SDL's controller mapping database, as GilRs 0.11.2 ships it.

Files: assets/glyphs/*
Copyright: 2026 Piotr Lewandowski and contributors
Comment: Ten of these are LineXinBar's own marks, carried over unchanged so that
 the greeter and the shell it hands over to do not put two different power
 symbols in front of the same user four seconds apart.
